menu "Smart IR slave configuration"

config SMART_IR_IR_TX_GPIO
    int "IR LED transmit GPIO"
    range 0 39
    default 4
    help
        GPIO connected to the IR LED transistor driver. The Daikin encoder is
        intentionally disabled until the exact protocol variant is selected.

config SMART_IR_TRANSACTION_IDLE_MS
    int "Idle time before deep sleep (ms)"
    range 100 1000
    default 250
    help
        Quiet interval after the last response. A new command restarts it,
        allowing the master to drain its queue before PRE_SLEEP_STATUS.

endmenu
